<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Columns and Rows</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>change columns &lt;number&gt;    how many characters on a line, 40 to 240
change rows &lt;number&gt;       how many lines on a page, 15 to 60
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>change columns 100
change rows 40
</pre>
<p>Tell the game the size of your screen, so that long texts are wrapped and 
paged to fit it. The default is 80 columns. Rows decide how much of a long 
text you see before it stops and waits for you to read on. Your settings 
are kept with your character.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Change</a>
</pre>




</div>